            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-lg p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
                <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-3 flex items-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-sky-600 mr-2"></i> Retroalimentación Detallada por Reactivo
